{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"da51257ff21818c2266ebec809ff81dda8fe96b02ad8e79c3da619300bfd0196","ja":"あっ、杏奈。\nもしかして、今までレッスンしてたの？","zh":"啊，杏奈。\n难道说，你刚才一直在练习吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0b25383681c31b58c4f46317cbf51f74928eef513230f3d4f24817e626567d6e","ja":"うん……新しい曲……もっと上手に\n踊れるように……なりたいから……！","zh":"嗯……因为我想把新歌……\n跳得……更好……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f52172ac516ca3596566f26cc09521bc1d1b7c37e226058ac0c2290a3b086186","ja":"すご～い！　さっきもね、紗代子ちゃんたちと、\n杏奈すっごく頑張ってるよねって話してたんだ。","zh":"好厉害～！刚才我还和小纱代子她们\n聊起杏奈真的特别努力呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d8b79ce4f877599502e50ff0e69f05bc8ef8902d46d6b27565343e54bf1b2a78","ja":"えへへ……♪　ありがと。\n疲れるまでレッスンして……良かった、な……。","zh":"嘿嘿……♪　谢谢你。\n练到这么累……真是太好了、呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b18eaef14ea77e9b9c3f9354bd2c26ef1940adf2349b3f09d1d9293578ab9296","ja":"（……でも、頑張りすぎちゃったかも。\n帰る前に……ちょっとだけ、休んでこう、かな……？）","zh":"（……不过，可能有点太拼了。\n回去之前……稍微，休息一下再走，吧……？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5ef85720a5bfa658d65019c05adc015bc824d9328391282336c388158715d207","ja":"（なんだか、とっても……眠く……なって……）","zh":"（总觉得，好……困……了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"854a4eebac3b6066b1338467558264cd4f593b41c02effd07f2ce1dea9807b9c","ja":"あれ？　……杏奈……なんで外、に……？\n……？　ここ……どこ……？","zh":"咦？……杏奈……怎么在外面……？\n……？这里……是哪里……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"217eae2e7ba243915bd7d5784b3e47029765ea7b46ca45db56316c2eb6b51749","ja":"……チョコの匂いがする……？\r\n甘くて……とっても､いい匂い……。","zh":"……有巧克力的香味……？\n甜甜的……非常，好闻……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f3048b006a1519e77eb971ab79405fabf794e900ab7e922a7186004183a87bfc","ja":"あ……道が、茶色……もしかして、チョコ！？\n門とか、壁、も……お菓子でできてる……の？","zh":"啊……路面是棕色的……难道说，是巧克力！？\n大门、墙壁，也都是……用点心做成的……吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"400ca8e818621b486067a9ad863df1954b190a0cf188d165cf99e8c65b117101","ja":"あれ？　あなた、そこで何をして……。","zh":"咦？你在那里做什么……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"fb21bbeac74255b93336b1f7bc78fb9da689d439a306db22ef4dd50284027648","ja":"あっ！　もっ、もしかして、あなたは\n伝説のショコラティエ様ですかっ！？","zh":"啊！难、难道说，您就是\n传说中的巧克力大师吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"83a6893a53156607ae1a0fe5ade61000ca60cf4d56aec6d6f37dfc0652c9e4d0","ja":"……え？　未来……なに、言ってるの……？\nここは、どこ……？","zh":"……诶？未来……你在说什么啊……？\n这里是……哪里……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"1a2c7f25c537bb373d2746feefaece6d09bb59fc138cc9bb7f26f7e42c933dbc","ja":"ここはチョコの国です！　やっぱり\n他の国からきたんですね！　伝説の通りです！","zh":"这里是巧克力之国！您果然是\n从其他国家来的吧！正如传说中记载的一样！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1002.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"85d5c89cee46aa2652471e1598c34a9a9a38ab08fd6fccd8dc86cca7b27d0cf3","ja":"お願いします、ショコラティエ様！\n私たちの国を救ってくださ～～い！","zh":"拜托了，巧克力师大人！\n请救救我们的国家吧～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
